{"title":"Georgia mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Georgia_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Georgia middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Georgia_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Georgia high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Georgia_college_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Georgia college mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Resources</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Georgia_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">Georgia middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Georgia middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=298\">middle school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Archimedean_Challenge#1\" title=\"Archimedean Challenge\">Archimedean Challenge #1</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.gspe.org/mathcounts.htm\">Georgia MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Berry_College_Math_Contests&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Berry College Math Contests (page does not exist)\">Berry College Math Contests</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://fsweb.berry.edu/academic/mans/cmoldavan/math_contest/78tests.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cobb_County_Math_Meets\" title=\"Cobb County Math Meets\">Cobb County Math Meets</a>—only for Cobb County students</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Forsyth_County\" title=\"Forsyth County\">Forsyth County</a> (All-County Middle School Math Tournament)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=GCTM_Middle_School_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"GCTM Middle School Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">GCTM Middle School Math Tournament</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_Junior_Varsity_State_Tournament\" title=\"Georgia Junior Varsity State Tournament\"> Junior Varsity State Tournament</a> (hosted by Woodward Academy)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rockdale_Mathematics_Competition\" title=\"Rockdale Mathematics Competition\">Rockdale Mathematics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://home.comcast.net/%7Edrgarnerjr/RMC.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Walton_MathFest\" title=\"Walton MathFest\">Walton MathFest</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Georgia_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">Georgia high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Georgia high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=214\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://centralmathmeet.yolasite.com/\">Central Math Meet</a>(grades 9 - 12)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_ARML\" title=\"Georgia ARML\">Georgia ARML</a> competes at the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Regions_Mathematics_League\" title=\"American Regions Mathematics League\">American Regions Mathematics League</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Archimedean_Challenge#1\" title=\"Archimedean Challenge\">Archimedean Challenge #1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Armstrong_Atlantic_State_University_High_School_Mathematics_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Armstrong Atlantic State University High School Mathematics Tournament (page does not exist)\">Armstrong Atlantic State University High School Mathematics Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.math.armstrong.edu/tournaments/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Augusta_State_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Augusta State Math Contest (page does not exist)\">Augusta State Math Contest </a><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.gctm.org/contrib/augusta_state_results_2005.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cherokee_County_Open_Math_Tournament\" title=\"Cherokee County Open Math Tournament\">Cherokee County Open Math Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://webtech.cherokee.k12.ga.us/math/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cobb_County_Invitational\" title=\"Cobb County Invitational\">Cobb County Invitational</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cobb_County_Math_Meets\" title=\"Cobb County Math Meets\">Cobb County Math Meets</a>—only for Cobb County students</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Columbus_High_Invitational\" title=\"Columbus High Invitational\">Columbus High Invitational</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Columbus_State_University_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Columbus State University Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">Columbus State University Math Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://math.columbusstate.edu/tournament/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=GACS_-_Dwight_Love_Math_Tournament\" title=\"GACS - Dwight Love Math Tournament\">GACS - Dwight Love Math Tournament</a>&#8212;a large middle and high school tournament. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.gacs.pvt.k12.ga.us/facstaff/sbaggett/math_tournament.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=GCTM_State_Math_Tournament\" title=\"GCTM State Math Tournament\">GCTM State Math Tournament</a> This tournament determines the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_ARML\" title=\"Georgia ARML\">Georgia ARML</a> team. By invitation only.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_Southern_Invitational_Mathematics_Tournament\" title=\"Georgia Southern Invitational Mathematics Tournament\">Georgia Southern Invitational Mathematics Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://cost.georgiasouthern.edu/math/tourny/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_Southwestern_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Georgia Southwestern Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">Georgia Southwestern Math Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.gsw.edu/~math/mathtourn.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_Tech_High_School_Math_Competition\" title=\"Georgia Tech High School Math Competition\">Georgia Tech High School Math Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://hsmc.gatech.edu\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Kell_Invitational_Mathematics_Tournament\" title=\"Kell Invitational Mathematics Tournament\">Kell Invitational Mathematics Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.geocities.com/coachshildneck/tournament.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Kennesaw_State_University_Mathematics_Competition\" title=\"Kennesaw State University Mathematics Competition\">Kennesaw State University Mathematics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://math.kennesaw.edu/~ckoppelm/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_Junior_Varsity_State_Tournament\" title=\"Georgia Junior Varsity State Tournament\"> Junior Varsity State Tournament</a> (hosted by Woodward Academy) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.woodward.edu/academics/us/math/mathteam_sjv_tournament.asp\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Lakeside_High_School_Varsity_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Lakeside High School Varsity Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">Lakeside High School Varsity Math Tournament</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Lassiter_Invitational\" title=\"Lassiter Invitational\">Lassiter Invitational</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mercer_University_High_School_Mathematics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Mercer University High School Mathematics Competition (page does not exist)\">Mercer University High School Mathematics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mercer.edu/math/math_contest/contest.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Milton_High_School_Math_Tournament\" title=\"Milton High School Math Tournament\">Milton High School Math Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www2.fultonschools.org/teacher/pricea2/MathVarsity/MVarsityMilTourn.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=North_Fulton_Varsity_Invitational_Math_Tournament\" title=\"North Fulton Varsity Invitational Math Tournament\">North Fulton Varsity Invitational Math Tournament</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=NGCSU_Invitational_Math_Tournament&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"NGCSU Invitational Math Tournament (page does not exist)\">NGCSU Invitational Math Tournament </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rockdale_Mathematics_Competition\" title=\"Rockdale Mathematics Competition\">Rockdale Mathematics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://home.comcast.net/%7Edrgarnerjr/RMC.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Soli_Deo_Gloria_Fall_Tournament,_aka_Billy%27s_Math_Meet&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Soli Deo Gloria Fall Tournament, aka Billy&#39;s Math Meet (page does not exist)\">Soli Deo Gloria Fall Tournament, aka Billy's Math Meet</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Solafidefarms/MathMeet\" title=\"User:Solafidefarms/MathMeet\">User:Solafidefarms/MathMeet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Georgia_Mathematics_Tournament\" title=\"University of Georgia Mathematics Tournament\">University of Georgia Mathematics Tournament</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.math.uga.edu/mathmeet.html\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Georgia_college_mathematics_competitions\">Georgia college mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Georgia college mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gainesville_College_Math_Tournament_for_Two-Year_Colleges&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Gainesville College Math Tournament for Two-Year Colleges (page does not exist)\">Gainesville College Math Tournament for Two-Year Colleges</a>  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.gc.peachnet.edu/math/tournament/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.gctm.org/competitions\">List of Dates of Georgia Math Tournaments</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017135441\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 63/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argum